{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to UtherWorld \u2014 the next evolution in adult social MMOs featuring a charming and fun Retro style! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a fully realized virtual world built for connection, creativity, and freedom. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed by a world-leading team with 18 years of experience in online social platforms and virtual worlds, UtherWorld blends the thrill of meeting real people with the creativity of building and customizing your own space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In UtherWorld, every avatar is a real person, every outfit tells a story, and every moment is a chance to connect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here to meet new people, find romance, design stunning clothing, or build your dream property \u2014 UtherWorld gives you the tools (and the audience) to make it happen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes \u2014 the more you create and connect, the more you earn to spend across UtherWorld. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/c8613f4e3bcd498a089e8e5d204c7876.avif?t=1767638097\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras_big/c8613f4e3bcd498a089e8e5d204c7876.webp?t=1767638097 width=1560 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras/e3ecefbd4a2ff7a3e6c611774c428c2d.avif?t=1767638097\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037420/extras_big/e3ecefbd4a2ff7a3e6c611774c428c2d.webp?t=1767638097 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world buzzing with real personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, flirt, dance and get sexy. Discover others fro